  m_text: 'Controls


    Movement:

    - Mouse to look around.

    - WASD keys
    to walk.

    - Left shift (hold) to run.

    - Space to Jump.


    Weapon:

    -
    Left click to shoot.

    - R key to reload.

    - Q/scrollwheel key to cycle
    equipped weapons.'
